{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["To meet Nahashim — to test from place to place, perhaps he would be able to curse them. Only from this point on he intended to bless them with a whole heart, and on account of this it is written here: וַתְּהִי עָלָיו רוּחַ אֱלֹהִים — that the spirit of the Shekhinah rested upon him from love, in a manner of affection."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:50:51.914283986Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}